 the word for a young bird?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"A chick is a young bird; a fawn is a young deer, and a kitten is a young cat.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-76f7-b20b-f0579977e766","description":"A Chick","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-7450-a979-e053a905b8bf","description":"A Bunny","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-7ef8-87a7-d7fd9c592c84","description":"A Fawn","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-7fc1-b19f-7dbc778cac63","description":"A Kitten","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-74d4-9059-2265dc7a29f9","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"What is Neurology the study of?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Neurology is the medical branch dealing with disorders of the nervous system.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-7eb6-998e-641feb1092df","description":"The nervous system","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-791f-8be1-31f5b161e2f5","description":"Embryos","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-77b7-9bd8-786749de035f","description":"Mollusks","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-7a59-ac0d-069383f5a02e","description":"Bones","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-7476-a68c-e05b23ddb250","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"How many bits are there in a byte?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"A byte is conventionally eight bits. The term octet is used when exactly eight bits must be specified, since byte sizes were not always universal.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-793f-8987-c6f4138af642","description":"8","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-7e7d-b79e-cc809daf8139","description":"2","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-7754-a3ab-f794272e0bc5","description":"4","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-77ec-9af4-d338e25750c9","description":"16","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-7e20-96bf-a9824cf16044","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"What kind of animal is a kookaburra?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"A kookaburra is a bird in the kingfisher family, and its call sounds remarkably like human laughter.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-7a3e-84c7-e97d4d6f0e02","description":"Bird","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-73ed-a49a-75c27558c2ec","description":"Mammal","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-796b-91d5-84aa63a1955b","description":"Fish","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-7076-aa9a-d879b7947b8b","description":"Reptile","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-78e5-b1ed-488bd43b4eaa","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"What process is used when kidneys are not working properly?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Dialysis can clean the blood through a machine or use the lining of the abdomen as a filter.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-7a17-8f68-7bc5b0132c24","description":"Dialysis","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-7b7f-b39f-17dcc2c6464e","description":"Chemotherapy","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-7d82-b822-9523424c6e5c","description":"Physiotherapy","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-735c-99e2-432e9d06db70","description":"Radiation","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-762d-9960-f737c8557fd5","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"What is testosterone?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Testosterone is a hormone involved in sexual development and helps support muscle and bone growth.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-75ee-93f7-d20d15502b36","description":"A hormone","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-7c8a-8a94-18396957a2ac","description":"A gland","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-7f7e-a75d-4c559a4532b2","description":"An amino acid","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-7620-9b7e-4f32090f2ae0","description":"A sugar","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae84-7e4b-a69c-874519f7431a","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"Which web browser wa